    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d604">

                <pb facs="0656" n="552" xml:id="pg552"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 868.001 G 29/3.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé d’Affaires of Greece to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Royal Greek Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 19, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I make it my painful duty to inform your excellency that my Sovereign, George I,
                    King of the Hellenes, died yesterday at Saloniki, in the afternoon, from the
                    effects of an attempt on His August Person.</p>
                <p>Be pleased [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Vouros</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
